caption: Vampire Field Manual — 🪖 Starbucks Contractor Response Protocol
campaign-component: starbucks-contractor-response-protocol

STEP 1: IDENTIFY

Pale, elegant, probably making prolonged eye contact?

Mentions “eternal night,” “the gift of immortality,” or “how dry the vintage is”?
 → Confirm Vampiric Hostile Classification.

STEP 2: ENGAGE (If You Must)

Maintain at least 10 meters distance.

Deploy light-enhanced or incendiary weaponry (Mk IV Solar Rifle or equivalent).

Aim for center mass, head, or unholy sigil clusters.

Do not attempt witty banter — corporate studies show this increases fatality rate by 37%.

STEP 3: RETREAT / REPORT
 If engagement fails or adversary exhibits flight, teleportation, or conversational seduction:

Withdraw immediately.

Call in Team Latte (Anti-Undead Response) via radio Channel 6.

Fill out Incident Form 6-U (Undead Contact), 6-M (Magical Contamination), and, if applicable, 6-E (Employee Deceased).
